    "complexity": "Simple",
    "description": "A choir of lost souls rises out of the floor, singing an eerie chant that terrifies its listeners and buffets their bodies with walls of sound.",
    "disable": "DC 28 Performance (trained) to disrupt the song\u2019s resonance with another tune or DC 28 Religion (trained) to ritually silence the spirits",
